Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.19,0:00:20.89,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Oh, this is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:23.62,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,And the weather is great today, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.23,0:00:26.59,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Fuwari!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.59,0:00:27.31,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.19,0:00:33.14,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Huh? You want me to do a concert with SoLaMi Smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.14,0:00:34.19,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,That's right-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.61,0:00:38.86,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It would make me really happy if you would form a Dream Team with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:40.62,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Dream Team?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.62,0:00:47.25,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,A Dream Team is a five person team who performs a Theatre Concert in the Dream Theatre.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.69,0:00:51.58,Default,Sohpie,0,0,0,,I'm certain we'd get along perfectly, Fuwari-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:55.76,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Crap! SoLaMi Smile got to her first!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.16,0:01:00.99,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,It's regrettable that we let them take the initiative.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.81,0:01:05.32,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,I think Fuwari-chan would get along with us as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.43,0:01:09.81,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Tch. Looks like everyone had the same idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.81,0:01:12.29,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'll make sure that Fuwari joins Alomagedon!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.29,0:01:13.65,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Neko?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.22,0:01:17.66,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,PriPara Museum is reopening-nekon?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.77,0:01:22.07,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I just got a great idea-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.26,0:02:56.01,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,The Demon Museum-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.98,0:03:02.97,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,My, is this a present from Hibiki-sama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.97,0:03:07.44,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,The Making Drama "Shine! Gorgeous Celeb Princess!"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:11.89,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,This must be the Making Drama Hibiki-sama wants you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.89,0:03:16.03,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think it fits me perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.03,0:03:20.69,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,It's several times better than the Making Drama I had in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.94,0:03:25.94,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,It's such a wonderful and gorgeous Making Drama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.94,0:03:28.12,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,I wouldn't expect anything less from Hibiki-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:32.53,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,With that, you'll be starting your special training today, Midorikaze Fuwari-san
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.53,0:03:34.71,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Let's get this exciting training going!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:36.20,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Let's!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.47,0:03:36.20,Default-Alt,Ookanda,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:37.91,Default-Alt,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Now then, where should we start?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.91,0:03:41.42,Default-Alt,Ookanda,0,0,0,,W-Well, the theme is  gorgeous celeb princess so...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.94,0:03:43.51,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,An invitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:47.56,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,You have been invited to the Angel Museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.56,0:03:51.47,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Why not learn more about Making Dramas at the PriPara Museum?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.09,0:03:53.10,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.40,0:03:54.96,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:57.11,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.11,0:03:59.86,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,All right, let's get started right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.86,0:04:00.57,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.57,0:04:02.53,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,And un, deux, trois.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.53,0:04:03.78,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Un, deux, trois.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.78,0:04:05.02,Default,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Look at your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.02,0:04:06.03,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.02,0:04:06.45,Default-Alt,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Un, deux, trois.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.45,0:04:06.99,Default-Alt,Ookanda,0,0,0,,Now spin.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.69,0:04:09.45,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.45,0:04:11.07,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.07,0:04:11.91,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.32,0:04:16.58,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.34,0:04:18.56,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.56,0:04:19.04,Default,Laphie,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.04,0:04:21.50,Default,Mirion,0,0,0,,An invitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.93,0:04:27.47,Default,Mirion,0,0,0,,Come take a tour of PriPara Museum with the popular and natural idol, Fuwari-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.47,0:04:32.44,Default,Mirion,0,0,0,,Maybe you can even become a Dream Team{makes more sense than friend or companion IMO} with Fuwari-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.44,0:04:34.18,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,A golden opportunity!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.18,0:04:36.26,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's not let this chance slip by!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.26,0:04:36.93,Default,Dorna,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.93,0:04:39.16,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,This is our shot at teaming up-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.16,0:04:40.15,Default,Laphie,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.15,0:04:42.79,Default-Alt,All,0,0,0,,...to PriPara Museum!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.79,0:04:46.44,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Thou did a wonderful job delivering those invitations.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.44,0:04:50.28,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Red bean buns and melon buns are delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:55.29,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Midorikaze Fuwari, thou shall fall into the palm of mine hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:01.30,Default,All,0,0,0,,Fuwari.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.30,0:05:03.53,Default,All,0,0,0,,We look forward to hanging out with you today!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.53,0:05:04.25,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.44,0:05:07.74,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Ah, same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.74,0:05:09.72,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Let's have a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.72,0:05:13.80,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Of course you guys also came here in hopes of getting Fuwari, huh-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.80,0:05:16.32,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,That's our line!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.32,0:05:18.77,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Fuwari belongs to Dressing Parfait after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.77,0:05:19.96,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.96,0:05:20.95,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.95,0:05:22.94,Default-Alt,Toriko,0,0,0,,Don't-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.95,0:05:22.94,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Don't-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.95,0:05:22.94,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,{\3c&HC44742&}Don't-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.49,0:05:26.11,Default,3,0,0,0,,Don't go in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.11,0:05:28.41,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What's going on-pri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.07,0:05:31.33,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,This is the location of the cursed museum,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.33,0:05:34.87,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,that is said to have been built on an ancient mascot graveyard-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.87,0:05:39.04,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,The zombie mascots who no longer rest in peace will attack you-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.46,0:05:41.25,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Cursed museum?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.25,0:05:43.25,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Zombie mascots?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.25,0:05:47.51,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,It happened long long ago-kuma. {A long long time ago or Once upon a time is more of the english equivalent IMO, but I kind of like this}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.51,0:05:52.34,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,The place where the PriPara Museum was built,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:55.22,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,was also a graveyard for mascots abandoned by their idols.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:59.70,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,The mascots' despair eventually become a curse,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:03.44,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,a curse from which the monster Parantula was born-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.44,0:06:05.89,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Those who dare enter this museum...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.89,0:06:08.65,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,...shall be surrounded and pursued by mascot zombies...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.65,0:06:11.49,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,...and forced to change into the Cursed Coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.49,0:06:15.49,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,And will in the end be eaten by the Parantula-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.49,0:06:15.49,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,And will in the end be eaten by the Parantula-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.07,0:06:17.66,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Cursed Coord?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.66,0:06:19.45,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,The zombie Parantula?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.45,0:06:20.98,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Don't go-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.98,0:06:24.46,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,If you do, Toriko will become fried chicken-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.46,0:06:25.53,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Deep fried and crispy-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.53,0:06:26.27,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Twice fried-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.27,0:06:27.39,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko will be delicious-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.39,0:06:28.69,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,It's serious-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.69,0:06:30.55,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko is completely serious-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.55,0:06:31.42,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,To!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.49,0:06:34.26,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.26,0:06:36.22,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,On second thought, I don't want to be eaten-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.40,0:06:40.50,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Curses and such are in fact 100% fictional-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:42.95,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Let's do whatever we can to get Fuwari!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.95,0:06:43.69,Default,Laphie,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.69,0:06:45.52,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Evil spirits begone!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.52,0:06:48.08,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,If there are zombies, we'll take them out in one fell swoop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.08,0:06:51.37,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,T-There's n-nothing to be scared of!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.37,0:06:53.53,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,If you say so, Dorthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.53,0:06:54.66,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,You heard them, Fuwari!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.66,0:06:56.34,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Let's go together-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.34,0:06:57.49,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Let's Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.49,0:06:58.44,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.44,0:06:59.95,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.95,0:07:00.70,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.70,0:07:02.20,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Don't leave me behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.20,0:07:03.50,Default-Alt,Usa,0,0,0,,Wait-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.20,0:07:03.50,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Wait-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.50,0:07:05.92,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Don't leave Toriko alone-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.07,0:07:12.26,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,They have been successfully lured into my trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.26,0:07:15.03,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Now they shall fall into my hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.84,0:07:16.82,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Kya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.82,0:07:17.97,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Something's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.97,0:07:20.18,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:22.35,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,It's a dinosaur exhibit-nano.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.35,0:07:23.23,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.64,0:07:25.85,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,It's a Tyrannosaurus-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.44,0:07:29.43,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,H-hmm! That's how they'll react we scare them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:30.58,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,They're coming-neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:31.32,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.19,0:07:35.78,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,This looks like a dinosaur exhibit-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.78,0:07:37.51,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Wow! It's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.51,0:07:38.69,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,It seems ye hath arrived,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.69,0:07:40.73,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,my foolish guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.24,0:07:44.42,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Welcome to my Demon Museum!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:46.46,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.46,0:07:47.54,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.54,0:07:48.92,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Haven't learned your lesson, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.92,0:07:52.13,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I'm talking to Princess Midorikaze.{119}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.13,0:07:55.03,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Make a contract with my team right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.03,0:08:00.60,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Otherwise the members of SoLaMi Smile and Dressing Parfait shall fall into hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:02.60,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Thank you for the invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:05.30,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,But, with how I am now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.30,0:08:07.69,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I'll only hold you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:09.94,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Is that still what you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.45,0:08:12.40,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Derodero Derosaimu!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.40,0:08:14.90,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Rise, my servants!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.90,0:08:17.91,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Oh? She's playing the demon again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.91,0:08:20.37,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What's it going to be this time-pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.37,0:08:22.62,Default,3,0,0,0,,Zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.83,0:08:24.94,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Something appeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.94,0:08:26.52,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:28.64,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Devi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.79,0:08:32.36,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,Get out of here already-usa!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.79,0:08:32.36,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Get out of here already-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.24,0:08:39.90,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,A curse-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.90,0:08:43.93,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Those who fail to become managers become cursed mascots-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.93,0:08:45.91,Default-Alt,Sophie,0,0,95,,Pushuu~. {sophie is love. sophie is life}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.91,0:08:47.39,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,That looks like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.14,0:08:51.07,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Everyone looks like they're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.07,0:08:52.73,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Fuwari, we've got to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.73,0:08:53.02,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:54.36,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,O-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:08:56.60,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,What's the meaning of this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.60,0:08:57.88,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Hold up-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.88,0:08:58.49,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:00.10,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,{Kyaa!}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.15,0:09:01.53,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,It's Mikan-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.53,0:09:02.14,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:03.83,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Calm down-neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.83,0:09:07.63,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Those zombies are actually some of my regulars-neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:09.62,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please-nekon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.62,0:09:12.65,Default,Mouse,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm busy with work that day-mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.65,0:09:13.74,Default,Araigamu{Racoon),0,0,0,,{\i1}Same here-arai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.74,0:09:15.37,Default,Kitsune(Fox),0,0,0,,{\i1}Me too-kitsune.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.09,0:09:17.66,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,{\i1}I see-neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.66,0:09:18.22,Default,3,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:21.47,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,{\i1}Then pay me for all the drinks you've had up to now-neko!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.47,0:09:22.68,Default,3,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.68,0:09:25.89,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,{\i1}In that case, be good and listen to what I say-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.58,0:09:29.77,Default,Araigame,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's a slave driver-arai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.65,0:09:31.79,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.79,0:09:34.19,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,So they aren't actually zombies-nano...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.57,0:09:38.10,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Everything's going as prophesied.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.10,0:09:40.53,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I'll do anything to get my hands on the princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.99,0:09:46.94,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,The mascot curse wasn't a joke-kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:49.62,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,It really is dangerous in here-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.62,0:09:50.46,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.92,0:09:56.13,Default,Both,0,0,0,,Parantula, it's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.13,0:09:59.63,Default,Both,0,0,0,,W-We're cursed!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.63,0:10:03.09,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,Hm? Cursed-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.63,0:10:03.09,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Hm? Cursed-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.09,0:10:06.23,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,Cursed-usa...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.09,0:10:06.23,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Cursed-kuma...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.43,0:10:11.71,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,However you look at it, those zombies are one of Aloma's tricks-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.71,0:10:15.39,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,In any case, this really is a collection of the world's wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.39,0:10:18.19,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,It's all so interesting-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.19,0:10:19.03,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Pri?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.03,0:10:21.30,Default,Dunno,0,0,0,,It's the mouth of truth-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.30,0:10:24.34,Default,Dunno,0,0,0,,I've always wanted to put my hand in it once-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.34,0:10:24.99,Default,Dunno,0,0,0,,Pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.99,0:10:27.33,Default,Dunno,0,0,0,,I-I can't get it out-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.33,0:10:30.70,Default,Kitsune,0,0,0,,As calculated-zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.70,0:10:36.17,Default,Kitsune,0,0,0,,The probability of you sticking your hand in it was 99.9%-zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:44.89,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,According to my analysis, there's a 99.99999% chance that you're a deadbeat mascot that Neko hired-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.99,0:10:46.91,Default,Kitsune,0,0,0,,Shut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.91,0:10:49.85,Default,Kitsune,0,0,0,,I have my grown-up reasons-kitsune!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.85,0:10:51.68,Default,Kitsune,0,0,0,,Take this! The cursed coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:52.94,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.94,0:10:55.56,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Stop! Cut it out-pri!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.11,0:10:58.11,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Squid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.11,0:11:00.82,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,A pop and dried squid tentacles...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:02.90,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,What's with this getup?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.90,0:11:06.42,Default,Kitsune,0,0,0,,Those costumes have been registered for today's concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:07.37,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.37,0:11:10.33,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.71,0:11:16.75,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,There's nothing to be scared of.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.75,0:11:19.25,Default,Mouse,0,0,0,,I found you-zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:23.55,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?! What are you going to do to us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.55,0:11:25.80,Default,Mouse,0,0,0,,If you don't dance in this coord,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.80,0:11:29.51,Default,Mouse,0,0,0,,I'll curse you by biting your ears and turning you blue-zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.98,0:11:33.47,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,It's not like I'm scared of a curse or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.10,0:11:38.49,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I-It's just happened to want to dance around in this outfit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.60,0:11:42.28,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Hani, hani. Hani, hani....
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.28,0:11:45.07,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,If you're going to dance, Dorthy...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.03,0:11:49.28,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,Arai... guma!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:52.41,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I'll take this into my own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.37,0:11:54.58,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Ara!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.94,0:11:57.83,Default,Araiguma,0,0,0,,Wash away the dirt that clings to it-arai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.14,0:11:59.30,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,You're open!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.30,0:12:00.84,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Evil spirit, begone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.84,0:12:02.59,Default,Araiguma,0,0,0,,It's clean again-arai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.91,0:12:05.34,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Wow, that's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.81,0:12:06.88,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Now, Mikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.88,0:12:08.09,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Right away-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.09,0:12:10.43,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Kaboom-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.98,0:12:15.48,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,That was fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.27,0:12:17.86,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,I was overconfident.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.86,0:12:18.94,Default,Araiguma,0,0,0,,You're open-araiguma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:23.82,Default,Araiguma,0,0,0,,Your hair-araiguma!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.86,0:12:26.32,Default,Araiguma,0,0,0,,Complete-arai!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.07,0:12:29.85,Default,Araiguma,0,0,0,,Do your concert like this-arai.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.85,0:12:31.78,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Rock bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.78,0:12:33.94,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Well done, Mikan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:35.62,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,That was a lot of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.62,0:12:38.58,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Just you wait, Princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.27,0:12:42.04,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Wow, a room of tapestries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.49,0:12:44.83,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I wonder where everyone else went...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.83,0:12:47.11,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Oh! A weaving loom.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.97,0:12:50.18,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,This takes me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.18,0:12:53.18,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,My gramps back in the Palps has one in his house.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.18,0:12:55.18,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Weaving loom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.18,0:12:56.23,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.23,0:12:59.14,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,We would often weave tapestries with one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.47,0:13:05.67,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,One of you still remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.67,0:13:06.65,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Manaka Lala!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.82,0:13:12.03,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Once I defeat thee, I'll have the princess all to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.03,0:13:13.69,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko is here, too-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.69,0:13:14.74,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Aloma!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.74,0:13:16.71,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,This isn't the right way to go about this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.71,0:13:18.21,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I won't hand Fuwari over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.21,0:13:19.75,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Toriko is here, too-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.75,0:13:22.38,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,It's foolish to go against a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.21,0:13:24.55,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I'll make thee realize that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.89,0:13:26.85,Default,3,0,0,0,,Zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.85,0:13:29.04,Default,Parantula(probably actually Kuma),0,0,0,,Parantula!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.08,0:13:34.11,Default,Parantula(probably actually Kuma),0,0,0,,I have no use for selfish idols!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.11,0:13:35.85,Default,Parantula(probably actually Kuma),0,0,0,,Pura~ Pura~!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.68,0:13:38.64,Default,Laoma,0,0,0,,Eh?!?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.64,0:13:42.60,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,I am Parantula!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.57,0:13:54.07,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,Parantula!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.99,0:13:56.39,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,That's odd-neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.39,0:13:58.75,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,I didn't make any previous arrangements with Kuma-neko.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.75,0:13:59.54,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Devi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:00.83,Default,3,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.83,0:14:02.54,Default,3,0,0,0,,It's going to eat us!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:04.25,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Hold it-neko!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.25,0:14:06.50,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,What happened to paying off your drinks-neko?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.62,0:14:08.53,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,N-No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.53,0:14:10.72,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Amazing, it's the real thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.72,0:14:13.76,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,Be nicer to mascots-para!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:13.76,Default-Alt,Lala,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.76,0:14:14.39,Default-Alt,Toriko,0,0,0,,Tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.39,0:14:16.35,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,Don't be selfish-para!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.94,0:14:19.98,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.98,0:14:21.31,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,This is amusing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.89,0:14:26.73,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,This is the curse of a mascot that has been pushed around by their idol-parapara!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.73,0:14:28.18,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.65,0:14:35.07,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,Pay us better-parapara...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.07,0:14:35.74,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.74,0:14:36.18,Default,Tori,0,0,0,,Tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.18,0:14:36.70,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Lala!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.70,0:14:38.37,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.14,0:14:39.83,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Lala!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.19,0:14:42.30,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I can't move...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.30,0:14:44.55,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,So tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.55,0:14:46.79,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Okay, it's not that bad-tori.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.79,0:14:49.50,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Parantula-san, please stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.50,0:14:52.88,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,I'm tired of hearing the requests of idols-para.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.88,0:14:57.47,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,I'll also hogtie you in my web created from the mascot curse-parapara.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.99,0:15:03.39,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,Now then, I'll begin my meal with you-para!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.31,0:15:06.36,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,A cursed thread...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:13.07,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,Yes. This is the hatred of managers who have been pushed around by their idols until now-para.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.70,0:15:17.28,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,But it's so pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.39,0:15:21.75,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,What did you just say-para?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.62,0:15:25.58,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,This thread is really beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.58,0:15:28.59,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I want to make a tapestry out of this thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.59,0:15:29.47,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Fuwari?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.47,0:15:30.13,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,T-
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.80,0:15:32.01,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.17,0:15:56.65,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Look at how pretty it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.65,0:16:00.78,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,We sing like this as we weave wool in the Palps too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.04,0:16:04.99,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,My cursed thread can be this beautiful-para...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.99,0:16:06.95,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,How pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.95,0:16:09.24,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,I-It is-para.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.26,0:16:13.70,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,This thread really isn't cursed-para.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.70,0:16:20.36,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,It really is the pure feelings of the mascots cheering on their idols-para.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.36,0:16:26.18,Default,Parantula,0,0,0,,Every mascot always cheers on their idol from the bottom of their heart-para.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.65,0:16:31.76,Default,Toriko,0,0,0,,Good job-tori!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:33.71,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Parantula-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.71,0:16:35.21,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.21,0:16:36.11,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.11,0:16:40.87,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,We would like to put that tapestry on display in the PriPara museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.87,0:16:43.78,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,O-Oh, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.78,0:16:48.06,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,I suppose being able to fight off Parantula is something a princess scholarship students would be able to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.06,0:16:50.06,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Though, I suppose it was a bit different here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:52.34,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Mikan's starving!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.34,0:16:55.08,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I really want to form a team with Fuwari!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.15,0:17:00.59,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.59,0:17:01.76,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,Where-usa?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.76,0:17:02.93,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.93,0:17:06.48,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Parantula was actually Kuma-san and Usagi-san?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.48,0:17:08.88,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,What are you talking about-kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:10.48,Default,Usagi,0,0,0,,My head hurts-usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.49,0:17:14.44,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,So you two were the masterminds behind this, huh-pri?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.39,0:17:18.28,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,How dare you force me to wear this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.28,0:17:19.91,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Time for a beat down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.78,0:17:22.87,Default,Kusagi,0,0,0,,Could this be...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.87,0:17:26.33,Default-Alt,Usagi,0,0,0,,...the idol curse-usa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.87,0:17:26.33,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,...the idol curse-kuma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:30.92,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Could the Parantula's curse really have been true-nekon?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.92,0:17:33.79,Default,Neko,0,0,0,,Well, not like I really care either way-nekon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.79,0:17:36.00,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Capturing Fuwari may have failed,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.00,0:17:38.10,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,but I got a hint for a new Making Drama!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.10,0:17:39.84,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,That's great!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.43,0:17:43.26,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,This is delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.28,0:17:49.43,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Please scan the appropriate number of My Tickets for your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.27,0:17:52.69,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,You can also scan each other's Friend Tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:55.69,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,Coord Change Start!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.41,0:18:00.07,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,The Museum has changed some of your coord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.07,0:18:03.57,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,There is art on display in your blue sky pattern skirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.57,0:18:06.16,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Blue Sky Museum Amazing Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.51,0:18:07.53,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Devi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.74,0:18:14.25,Default,Mega-nee,0,0,0,,You can't help but feel the history that stems from the engravings depicted on the dusk pattern top!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.25,0:18:17.34,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Dusk Pattern Museum Amazing Coord!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:19.01,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Gelrun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.17,0:18:23.18,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Aloma and...{consistency}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.18,0:18:24.08,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,...Mikan.{consistency}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:25.89,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,An angel and demon...{consistency}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.89,0:18:28.70,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,...shall take you to heaven.{consistency}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.70,0:18:30.46,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,No, to hell.{consistency}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.58,0:19:47.39,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,Making Drama Switch On!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.55,0:19:49.80,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,This is exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.12,0:19:54.44,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Give me back my treasure-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:57.02,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.90,0:20:02.40,Default,Kuma,0,0,0,,Give me back my treasure-kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.40,0:20:04.40,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Here it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.57,0:20:08.47,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,The Amazing Museum...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.47,0:20:11.41,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,...of Mystery!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.26,0:20:15.38,Default,Alomagedon,0,0,0,,Cyalume Change!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.63,0:21:03.39,Default,Mikan,0,0,0,,Thank you-nano!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.39,0:21:04.30,Default,Aloma,0,0,0,,Bow down before me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.30,0:21:09.45,Default,Mirelle,0,0,0,,It's pretty cunning of those two to actually take today's events and adapt them into a Making Drama-pri.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.45,0:21:10.73,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.73,0:21:11.69,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,100)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.69,0:21:13.10,Default,Leona,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,0)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.51,0:21:16.27,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,Their plans may have failed,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:19.62,Default,Shion,0,0,0,,but they got something positive out of it. They have my respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.62,0:21:23.05,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,Like I said, I wasn't scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:24.86,Default,Dorthy,0,0,0,,I really wasn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.86,0:21:28.02,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Someday... Someday I'll make sure to...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.02,0:21:30.88,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,...perform a gorgeous Making Drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.88,0:21:33.66,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Please watch over me, Prince-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.99,0:23:08.50,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,Why aren't you happy, Fuwari-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:11.09,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,I received a new Making Drama from Prince-sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.78,0:23:13.34,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,but I'm worried if I can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.87,0:23:17.26,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Am I really worthy of being a princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.26,0:23:18.98,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Don't waver!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.98,0:23:20.64,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I want you to believe in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.64,0:23:21.77,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Prince-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.77,0:23:24.93,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,I'll show you the World of Princesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.93,0:23:26.69,Default,Hibiki,0,0,0,,Here, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.69,0:23:28.23,Default,Lala,0,0,0,,It's crazy gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.23,0:23:29.38,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,Next time:
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.38,0:23:32.18,Default,Fuwari,0,0,0,,A Date with Prince and the Goat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.18,0:23:33.44,Default,All,0,0,0,,Aim for your dreams!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.44,0:23:34.90,Default,All,0,0,0,,Let's go PriPara!
